-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2811-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2811-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2811-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2811-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6241\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1920&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6241\" class=\"wp-image-6241\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-scaled.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/IMG_2819-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/MVI_2888.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>Just one of the many waterfalls in Yellowstone NP<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/MVI_2879.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>We saw swans more than once &#8230; so graceful<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/MVI_2918.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>Bison Crossing The Road<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/MVI_2965.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>Old Faithful<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;ve never been to Yellowstone National Park, I&#8217;d like to tell you that you should plan on spending a few days there &#8230; especially if you like to hike.  Even if you&#8217;re just driving through the park in your car and using the pull-offs to stop and see the scenery, it can (and should) take days.  Even though we visited in mid-September after schools were back in session, it was still a busy park.  There&#8217;s just so much to see.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6191\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6191\" class=\"wp-image-6191\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2829-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6192\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6192\" class=\"wp-image-6192\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190920_100610-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6193\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6193\" class=\"wp-image-6193\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2817-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6194\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6194\" class=\"wp-image-6194\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2827-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6195\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6195\" class=\"wp-image-6195\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/20190921_114402-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834.jpg?fit=685%2C514&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6196\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6196\" class=\"wp-image-6196\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/09\/IMG_2834-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/11\/MVI_2809.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>The &#8220;Dragon&#8217;s Mouth&#8221;<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re not already subscribed to this blog, you can easily do so by scrolling up to the top of any page and entering your email address in the block on the right side.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also subscribe to our YouTube channel (<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/results?search_query=herbnkathyrv\" target=\"_blank\">herbnkathyrv<\/a>) on You Tube.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re curious (at any time) to know where we are at that moment then click the button at the top right of this page labeled \u201c<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/aprs.link\/app\/aprs\/stations\/googlemap-WB8BHK-9\" target=\"_blank\">See Where We Are Now<\/a>\u201c.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019d love to hear from you. If you scroll all the way down to the bottom of this page, you can send us a note. Again, thanks for riding along. \u2019til next time \u2013 safe travels.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>I haven&#8217;t posted for the longest time and I&#8217;ve been feeling guilty about that. I wanted to fill you in on what&#8217;s been going on and where we&#8217;ve been over the last couple of months. The reason I haven&#8217;t posted is because we&#8217;ve had very limited wifi. Our Verizon Jet Pack has a 25 gig &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/12\/03\/yellowstone\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Yellowstone<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707329],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-6190","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-traveling"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6190","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[